            &nbsp;<font color="#ffffff"><b>Comments</b></font>&nbsp;
        </td>
        <td>&nbsp;</td>
    </tr>
    </table>

    <table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%" class="grid" style="margin: 0;">
                <tr id="comment-header-17264094"><td bgcolor="#f0f0f0">
            Comment by  
                                                        <a class="user-hover" rel="veganap" id="word_commented_veganap" href="https://jira.oci.oraclecorp.com/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=veganap">Venkat Ganapathy</a>
                                        <font size="-2">
            [
                <font color="#336699">02/Oct/25</font>

                            ]
            </font>

        </td></tr>
        <tr id="comment-body-17264094"><td bgcolor="#ffffff">
            <p>A security exception has been filed, approved and expires 30/Jan/2026 (<a href="https://jira-sd.mc1.oracleiaas.com/browse/SDR-31649" class="external-link" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener">SDR-31649)</a></p>
        </td></tr>
                <tr id="comment-header-16908114"><td bgcolor="#f0f0f0">
            Comment by  
                                                        <a class="user-hover" rel="veganap" id="word_commented_veganap" href="https://jira.oci.oraclecorp.com/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=veganap">Venkat Ganapathy</a>
                                        <font size="-2">
            [
                <font color="#336699">21/Aug/25</font>

                            ]
            </font>

        </td></tr>
        <tr id="comment-body-16908114"><td bgcolor="#ffffff">
            <p>Related service tickets:<br/>
<a href="https://jira.oci.oraclecorp.com/browse/ODBX-9506" class="external-link" rel="nofollow">https://jira.oci.oraclecorp.com/browse/ODBX-9506</a><br/>
<a href="https://jira.oci.oraclecorp.com/browse/INDIGO-20739" class="external-link" rel="nofollow">https://jira.oci.oraclecorp.com/browse/INDIGO-20739</a><br/>
<a href="https://jira.oci.oraclecorp.com/browse/ODBX-9507" class="external-link" rel="nofollow">https://jira.oci.oraclecorp.com/browse/ODBX-9507</a><br/>
<a href="https://jira.oci.oraclecorp.com/browse/ODBX-9563" class="external-link" rel="nofollow">https://jira.oci.oraclecorp.com/browse/ODBX-9563</a><br/>
 </p>
        </td></tr>
                <tr id="comment-header-16884980"><td bgcolor="#f0f0f0">
            Comment by  
                                                        <a class="user-hover" rel="veganap" id="word_commented_veganap" href="https://jira.oci.oraclecorp.com/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=veganap">Venkat Ganapathy</a>
                                        <font size="-2">
            [
                <font color="#336699">19/Aug/25</font>

                            ]
            </font>

        </td></tr>
        <tr id="comment-body-16884980"><td bgcolor="#ffffff">
            <p>Reached out to the SecArch team member who initially reported these hazards. Two service teams ORP and DeepHealthCheck determined that they are not impacted by this hazard and resolved the corresponding ticket. </p>

<p>It seems this safety issue could be wide spread which could affect multiple services.</p>

<p>Next steps:</p>
<ul>
	<li>Figure out how we can communicate to other service teams that they need to verify if they are impacted by this hazard or not</li>
	<li>How to track and have tickets created in respective service team so they can document the impact findings and proceed with the remediation plan if impacted.</li>
</ul>

        </td></tr>
                <tr id="comment-header-16807803"><td bgcolor="#f0f0f0">
            Comment by  
                                                        <a class="user-hover" rel="veganap" id="word_commented_veganap" href="https://jira.oci.oraclecorp.com/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=veganap">Venkat Ganapathy</a>
                                        <font size="-2">
            [
                <font color="#336699">09/Aug/25</font>

                            ]
            </font>

        </td></tr>
        <tr id="comment-body-16807803"><td bgcolor="#ffffff">
            <ul>
	<li>Meeting notes on my conversation with <a href="https://jira.oci.oraclecorp.com/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=arsadasi" class="external-link" rel="nofollow">Arunkumar Sadasivan</a> from the Security Architecture team:</li>
	<li>Admin operations are allowed only via TCP and without AuthN/AuthZ</li>
	<li>Impact
	<ul>
		<li>Any service team who use “drop wizard” will be impacted by this hazard</li>
	</ul>
	</li>
	<li>Next steps:
	<ul>
		<li>Security Architecture team can only suggest remediation on the service they review and don’t have a way to enforce remediation across all the impacted services</li>
	</ul>
	</li>
</ul>

        </td></tr>
                <tr id="comment-header-16797733"><td bgcolor="#f0f0f0">
            Comment by  
                                                        <a class="user-hover" rel="veganap" id="word_commented_veganap" href="https://jira.oci.oraclecorp.com/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=veganap">Venkat Ganapathy</a>
                                        <font size="-2">
            [
                <font color="#336699">07/Aug/25</font>

                            ]
            </font>

        </td></tr>
        <tr id="comment-body-16797733"><td bgcolor="#ffffff">
            <p>I have reached out to the reporter to ask for some clarifications.</p>
        </td></tr>
            </table>
